      <item>
       <widget class="QLabel" name="aboutText">
        <property name="text">
         <string>&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0; line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;Nurture 2D is a traditional 2D animation software fork focused on giving animators the tools they need to produce professional‑looking work while remaining free and open source.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0; line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;N2D is a dream come true—built with animation first, and everything else second. This is a personal fork, so bugs are to be expected; that said, it is more than capable of doing what it is made to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin:8px 0; line-height:1.5;&quot;&gt;Distributed under the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html&quot;&gt;GNU General Public License, version 2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
        </property>
